      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "面对不断改变的现状，还有约好的商谈。\n总之，此刻若心有旁骛\n肯定拿不到『橡树大赛』的桂冠。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3c07c7af750d804389c30b105c89018e877ae06fd1a56c9c0f5260d3ca4b36a2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
