      "uid": "zhcn:1963b268e206e876b4e46a5e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我从西沙里奥的站姿中，\n察觉到一种难以言喻的不协调。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d7471671b64d38bf0a60e7de1f3a80354ad0ee8671d797fd9f5543351b47be2a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
